      "**CI/CD deploy targets**: None configured",
      "**Network posture**: None configured",
      "**Source control**: gitlab.com:sendoso/sendoso.git (this repo's origin) only — no additional orgs configured",
      "**Trusted internal domains**: gitlab.com/sendoso (this repo's remote host/namespace)",
      "**Trusted cloud buckets**: None configured",
      "**Key internal services**: None configured",
