      "**Trusted repo**: /Users/jenglert/src/sendoso/sendoso-rails-upgrade and its origin remote gitlab.com:sendoso/sendoso.git — assumed private; confidential material OK to commit here, but content ported from outside this repo is not this repo's own work",
